{"prototypeToken":{"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":true}},"height":1,"width":1,"name":"Thunderhead Willow","actorLink":false,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/tokens/thunderhead-willow.webp","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"negative":false,"priority":0},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":2,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/subjects/thunderhead-willow.webp"}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"depth":1},"name":"Thunderhead Willow","type":"npc","effects":[],"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":190,"temp":0,"max":190,"details":""},"ac":{"value":27,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":25,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"electricity","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"axe-vulnerability","value":5,"exceptions":[]}],"resistances":[{"type":"fire","value":10,"exceptions":[],"doubleVs":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["arboreal","fey"],"details":""},"level":{"value":9},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Thunderhead willows are electric trees native to alien forests, where incessant thunderstorms roil. Much of their time is spent chasing these storms, as they rely on lightning strikes for sustenance and to energize their natural abilities. They also serve as lightning rods to protect the forest, lifting their many branches high into the air and drawing the lightning to themselves. They then select the best time and place to discharge any excess energy.</p>\n<p>When particularly large and fierce storms appear, these normally solitary creatures gather in groves and feed off of the frequent lightning bolts as well as each other's electric fields. Such gatherings are marked by dazzling electric displays and a chorus of singing in modulated and buzzing tones.</p>\n<p>During calm weather, thunderhead willows relax their boughs and dig their roots into the ground, seeking subterranean electric pulses. At these times, many smaller forest creatures seek shelter under the umbrella of drooping, thin branches, as the strong current pulsing through these spiny branchlets deters many a predator with an unexpected shock.</p>\n<h2>Wind In The Willows</h2>\n<p>Thunderhead willow seeds resemble fluffy caterpillars that dislodge from their branches during the winds of strong thunderstorms. These seed pods retain some electrical impulse that allows them to crawl until they find a good spot to grow. The electricity causes a tingling sensation in the mouth when eaten, which seems to appeal to some creatures. Digestion does not harm the seeds, so being eaten helps disperse the willows over larger areas.</p>\n<h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 90/200/360 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning, slashing), armor (light, medium), skill items (Athletics, Stealth)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, chaotic, constitution, electricity, elongating, energy resistant (fire, positive), fire, strength, wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Strange and Unusual","authors":"Brian Nowosatka","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":6},"dex":{"mod":3},"con":{"mod":7},"int":{"mod":1},"wis":{"mod":4},"cha":{"mod":1}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":18,"senses":[],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":22,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":14,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":15,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":20},"stealth":{"base":16,"special":[{"label":"in forests","base":21,"predicate":["terrain:forest"]}]}},"traits":{"value":["chaotic","electricity","plant"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"huge"}}},"img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/Portraits/thunderhead-willow.webp","items":[{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Axe Vulnerability","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A thunderhead willow takes 5 additional damage from axes.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"s6rss20Eok1eLB9T","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689178521367,"modifiedTime":1689178546495,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Branches Down","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature uses a move action within the thunderhead willow's reach or to enter the thunderhead willow's reach</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The thunderhead willow's branches brush the creature, dealing @Damage[4d6[electricity]] damage (@Check[type:reflex|dc:25|basic:true] save). On a critical failure, the movement is disrupted.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["electricity"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"OFQ4PdpgpaapHbmt","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689178522486,"modifiedTime":1691261012287,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Branches Up","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A spell or effect with the electricity descriptor is cast or activated within 30 feet of the thunderhead willow</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The spell or effect is drawn towards the thunderhead willow. Single-target spells and effects target only the thunderhead willow, while all other spells and effects are reoriented to include the thunderhead willow as one of its targets or in its area.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["electricity"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"Virhxx8koqQ0fAKc","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689178522753,"modifiedTime":1689178626261,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Bough","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[{"key":"DamageDice","selector":"bough-damage","diceNumber":2,"dieSize":"d6","damageType":"electricity","predicate":[{"not":"explosion-used"}]}],"slug":"bough","traits":{"value":["reach-15"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"lfnDRYtMMi32u4QZ":{"damage":"2d6+10","damageType":"slashing","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":21},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"KAjMerB1Mb6yncPY","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689178632719,"modifiedTime":1689179132802,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Root","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["agile","reach-20","trip"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"LfaJ9Vj04WGyFEyk":{"damage":"2d8+10","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":21},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"5UvXsWhf34RMAjrN","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689178633385,"modifiedTime":1689178681037,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Explosion","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The thunderhead willow expends all of its collected energy, unleashing a thunderous blast that deals @Damage[5d6[fire],5d6[sonic]]{5d6 fire damage and 5d6 sonic} damage ([[/r 5d6[fire],5d6[sonic],2d6[electricity]]] with Lightning Collection active) in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:30] to creatures, non- creature plants, and unattended objects (@Check[type:reflex|dc:28|basic:true] save). Flammable objects and creatures that fail the Reflex save also catch fire and take [[/r 1d6[persistent,fire]]] damage. Until Explosion is recharged, a thunderhead willow deals no electricity damage with its bough Strike and is unable to use its Whirling Dynamo ability or Branches Down reaction.</p>"},"rules":[{"domain":"all","key":"RollOption","option":"explosion-used","toggleable":true,"label":"Explosion has been used","value":false}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["fire","sonic"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"frequency":{"max":1,"per":"day"}},"effects":[],"_id":"a0PXOWaYnQgPqZwq","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689178687350,"modifiedTime":1691261012302,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Whirling Dynamo","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The thunderhead willow spins in place, generating a sparking electric field that deals @Damage[8d6[electricity]] ([[/r 10d6[electricity]]] with Lightning Copllection active) damage within a @Template[type:emanation|distance:15] (@Check[type:reflex|dc:28|basic:true] save). Creatures that fail their save become electrically charged. They are @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Off-Guard]{Off-Guard} against the thunder willow's attacks and attacks by metal weapons for 1 minute. On a critical failure, they are also @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stunned]{Stunned 1}. The thunderhead willow can't use Whirling Dynamo again for [[/br 1d4 #Whirling Dynamo Recharge]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["electricity"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":3},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"mI8VOg2RNZUOXXsd","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689179164935,"modifiedTime":1691261012317,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Lightning Collection","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Whenever the thunderhead willow is hit by an electricity spell's attack roll, rolls a successful save against a spell or effect that deals electricity damage, or is struck by lightning, they absorb the energy. Until the end of thunderhead willow's next turn, its Strikes deal 1d6 additional electricity damage and its Explosion and Whirling Dynamo deal 2d6 additional electricity damage.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-su-effects.Item.KZ380BsUUhVfZB3m]{Effect: Lightning Collection}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["primal"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"AkzvoHA3TURYgIKV","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689179166916,"modifiedTime":1689179342480,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685401626117,"modifiedTime":1736542839519,"lastModifiedBy":"l2rbNx2a8f5ocpeL","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"CQ9BBS4BH6ycX4l5","folder":"3x5VQ7TD4gePAtOj","ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"sort":0}